WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Known as The Sparkly Alien,

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.300
she combines lived experience and professional practice

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.050
to create places where people belong
without becoming less of themselves.

4
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.800
How much of your life is going on
trying to fix yourself?

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.050
Think about it.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.250
Acceptance.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.900
Acceptance for all of you.

8
00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.800
There’s no expectations.
You don’t have to perform,

9
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.600
and you are very much free to be you.

10
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.200
And you belong simply because you exist.

11
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.000
So my question for you is this:

12
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.300
If you had more space,
what would you make room for?

13
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:48.800
If you weren’t doing the things that were hard
for you all the time and spending all of your energy,

14
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.600
what would that open up?

15
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.300
Where is your genius? Where is your joy?

16
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.200
[Preparing the singing close]

17
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.200
[Singing] I am strong.

18
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.500
I am invincible.

19
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:06.200
I am woman.

20
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.400
Thank you very much, everyone.

21
00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.000
[Applause]

